{"format":"kane-fabric-administrative-descriptor","format_version":1,"descriptor_id":"us.il.condominium.termination","descriptor_version":1,"title":"Illinois Condominium — Sale of Property & Removal from Act","help":"Statewide Illinois condominium terminal-lifecycle framework for a property-wide sale under Section 15 and unanimous removal from the Condominium Property Act under Section 16. Sale votes, objections, valuation records, lienholder consents, instruments, and closing records are association-instance data.","scope":{"country_code":"US","state_code":"IL","label":"Illinois statewide condominium infrastructure","applies_to":"condominium_sale_or_removal","as_of_date":"2026-09-17","admission_rule":"Only current-effective statewide Illinois condominium sale and removal-from-Act requirements are Infrastructure. Proposed legislation, local transaction procedures, purchaser terms, appraisals, lien records, closing details, and association-specific greater voting thresholds are instance data or deferred."},"categories":[{"id":"termination.sale","label":"Sale of condominium property"},{"id":"termination.owner_objection","label":"Objecting-owner protections"},{"id":"termination.valuation","label":"Valuation process"},{"id":"termination.removal","label":"Removal from Condominium Property Act"}],"authorities":[{"id":"il-condo-act-15","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/15","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/legislation/ilcs/fulltext?DocName=076506050K15","summary":"Property-wide sale voting thresholds, objecting-owner rights, relocation-cost treatment, and appraisal-panel procedure."},{"id":"il-condo-act-16","kind":"state_statute","citation":"765 ILCS 605/16","url":"https://www.ilga.gov/documents/legislation/ilcs/documents/076506050K16.htm","summary":"Unanimous removal from the Act, lienholder consent or lien transfer, recorded instrument, and resulting ownership in common."}],"pages":[{"id":"sale-removal","title":"Sale of Property & Removal from Act","help":"Section 15 sale and Section 16 removal are separate terminal-lifecycle paths. The statewide rules are Infrastructure; actual votes, objections, valuations, consents, instruments, and proceeds are association-instance evidence.","sections":[{"id":"statewide-termination-framework","title":"Statewide sale and removal framework","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-15","il-condo-act-16"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"sale-vote-thresholds","kind":"notice","text":"Unless the declaration or bylaws require a greater percentage, a property-wide sale under Section 15 requires a majority of unit owners for a 2-unit property, at least 66 2/3% for a 3-unit property, and at least 75% for a property containing 4 or more units.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-15"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"sale-meeting-binding-rule","kind":"notice","text":"The election to sell must occur by affirmative vote at a meeting of unit owners duly called for that purpose. When approved under Section 15, the action is binding on all unit owners and each owner must execute instruments and perform acts necessary to effect the sale.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-15"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":1,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"sale-objection-window","kind":"notice","text":"A unit owner who did not vote in favor of the sale may preserve the Section 15 objecting-owner protections by filing a written objection with the manager or board of managers within 20 days after the meeting at which the sale was approved.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-15"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"objector-proceeds-rule","kind":"notice","text":"An objecting owner who satisfies Section 15 is entitled from sale proceeds to the greater of the fair-appraised value of the owner's interest or the outstanding balance of qualifying bona fide acquisition/refinance debt secured by that interest, in each case less unpaid assessments or charges due from that owner.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-15"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"objector-relocation-rule","kind":"notice","text":"An objecting owner qualifying under Section 15 is also entitled to reimbursement from sale proceeds for reasonable relocation costs determined under the federal Uniform Relocation Assistance and Real Property Acquisition Policies Act framework referenced by Section 15.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-15"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"valuation-panel-rule","kind":"notice","text":"If an objecting owner and the prospective purchaser disagree on value, the owner may designate one valuation expert, the purchaser designates another, those experts mutually designate a third, and at least 2 of the 3 panel members determine the value.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-15"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":3,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"removal-unanimity-rule","kind":"notice","text":"Removal of the property from the Condominium Property Act under Section 16 requires all unit owners to join in a duly recorded removal instrument and all lienholders affecting units to consent or agree by recorded instruments that their liens transfer to the unit owner's resulting undivided interest. After removal, the property is owned in common, with each owner's undivided interest equal to that owner's former percentage interest in the common elements.","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-16"],"data_role":"infrastructure","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":12}}]},{"id":"sale-process-instance","title":"Property-wide sale process","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-15"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"termination-total-units","kind":"number","label":"Total condominium units","binding":"association.termination.sale.total_units","min":1,"step":1,"unit":"units","format":"integer","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-governing-threshold-reference","kind":"text","label":"Declaration/bylaw greater-threshold reference","binding":"association.termination.sale.greater_threshold_reference","help":"Leave blank if no greater association-specific threshold has been established.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":5}},{"id":"termination-sale-meeting-date","kind":"date","label":"Section 15 sale meeting","binding":"association.termination.sale.meeting_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"termination-sale-vote-percent","kind":"number","label":"Affirmative vote observed","binding":"association.termination.sale.affirmative_vote_percent","min":0,"max":100,"step":0.01,"unit":"%","format":"percent","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-sale-status","kind":"select","label":"Sale process status","binding":"association.termination.sale.status","options":[{"value":"not_initiated","label":"Not initiated"},{"value":"meeting_scheduled","label":"Meeting scheduled"},{"value":"approved","label":"Approved"},{"value":"not_approved","label":"Not approved"},{"value":"under_contract","label":"Under contract"},{"value":"closed","label":"Closed"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-purchaser-reference","kind":"text","label":"Prospective purchaser / transaction reference","binding":"association.termination.sale.purchaser_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-objection-deadline","kind":"date","label":"20-day objection deadline","binding":"association.termination.sale.objection_deadline","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":10,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-sale-contract-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Sale agreement / transaction reference","binding":"association.termination.sale.contract_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"termination-sale-closing-date","kind":"date","label":"Closing date","binding":"association.termination.sale.closing_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":7,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-sale-record-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Closing / conveyance record reference","binding":"association.termination.sale.record_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":10,"span":3}}]},{"id":"objecting-owner-instance","title":"Objecting-owner valuation and proceeds","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-15"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"termination-objectors","kind":"collection","label":"Objecting-owner records","binding":"association.termination.sale.objectors","min_items":0,"item_label":"Objecting owner","actions":{"add_label":"Add objecting owner","remove_label":"Remove objecting owner"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"termination-objector-unit","kind":"text","label":"Unit reference","binding":"unit_reference","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":2}},{"id":"termination-objector-objection-date","kind":"date","label":"Written objection filed","binding":"objection_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":3,"span":2}},{"id":"termination-objector-objection-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Objection reference","binding":"objection_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":5,"span":4}},{"id":"termination-objector-appraised-value","kind":"number","label":"Fair-appraised value","binding":"appraised_value","min":0,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":2}},{"id":"termination-objector-secured-debt","kind":"number","label":"Qualifying secured debt balance","binding":"secured_debt_balance","min":0,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":11,"span":2}},{"id":"termination-objector-unpaid-charges","kind":"number","label":"Unpaid assessments / charges","binding":"unpaid_assessments_charges","min":0,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-objector-relocation-costs","kind":"number","label":"Reasonable relocation costs","binding":"relocation_costs","min":0,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":4,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-objector-valuation-dispute","kind":"checkbox","label":"Valuation disputed","binding":"valuation_disputed","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":7,"span":2}},{"id":"termination-objector-panel-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Three-expert panel / valuation reference","binding":"panel_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"termination-objector-distribution","kind":"number","label":"Observed distribution","binding":"distribution","min":0,"unit":"USD","format":"currency","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-objector-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Proceeds / relocation notes","binding":"notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":4,"span":9}}]}]},{"id":"removal-from-act-instance","title":"Removal from the Condominium Property Act","authority_refs":["il-condo-act-16"],"layout":{"columns":12},"controls":[{"id":"termination-removal-status","kind":"select","label":"Removal status","binding":"association.termination.removal.status","options":[{"value":"not_initiated","label":"Not initiated"},{"value":"consents_pending","label":"Consents pending"},{"value":"instrument_prepared","label":"Removal instrument prepared"},{"value":"recorded","label":"Recorded"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-removal-owner-consent-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"All-owner consent / instrument reference","binding":"association.termination.removal.owner_consent_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":5}},{"id":"termination-removal-recorded-date","kind":"date","label":"Removal instrument recorded","binding":"association.termination.removal.recorded_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":4}},{"id":"termination-removal-record-reference","kind":"text","label":"Removal recording reference","binding":"association.termination.removal.record_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":4}},{"id":"termination-removal-lienholders","kind":"collection","label":"Lienholder consent / transfer records","binding":"association.termination.removal.lienholders","min_items":0,"item_label":"Lienholder","actions":{"add_label":"Add lienholder record","remove_label":"Remove lienholder record"},"item_layout":{"columns":12},"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":3,"column":1,"span":12},"item_controls":[{"id":"termination-lienholder-name","kind":"text","label":"Lienholder","binding":"lienholder","required":true,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":1,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-lienholder-unit","kind":"text","label":"Affected unit","binding":"unit_reference","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":4,"span":2}},{"id":"termination-lienholder-disposition","kind":"select","label":"Recorded disposition","binding":"disposition","options":[{"value":"consented","label":"Consent to removal"},{"value":"lien_transfer","label":"Lien transferred to undivided interest"},{"value":"pending","label":"Pending"},{"value":"unknown","label":"Not yet established"}],"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":6,"span":3}},{"id":"termination-lienholder-recorded-date","kind":"date","label":"Instrument recorded","binding":"recorded_date","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":1,"column":9,"span":2}},{"id":"termination-lienholder-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Recorded consent / transfer reference","binding":"record_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":2,"column":1,"span":12}}]},{"id":"termination-removal-resulting-interest-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Resulting undivided-interest schedule / reference","binding":"association.termination.removal.resulting_interest_reference","rows":2,"help":"Section 16 ties each resulting undivided interest to the owner's former common-element percentage.","data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":4,"column":1,"span":6}},{"id":"termination-removal-title-reference","kind":"textarea","label":"Post-removal title / ownership reference","binding":"association.termination.removal.title_reference","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":4,"column":7,"span":6}},{"id":"termination-removal-notes","kind":"textarea","label":"Removal notes","binding":"association.termination.removal.notes","rows":2,"data_role":"association_instance","layout":{"row":5,"column":1,"span":12}}]}]}]}